{"name":"菲谢尔","name_en":"Fischl","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：我即断罪之皇女，真名为菲谢尔。应命运的召唤降临在此间——哎？你也是，异世界的旅人吗…？那好吧，本皇女恩许你同行。奥兹：她的意思是「你好，很高兴认识你」。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6a9f1869197ccf2d8c23f54bd9048e74_4667897323212369392.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c23745f938856d58208e2babefe82936_9176756632846688712.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c1008d1974c7af16003fec2306395ea6_7234235350054088716.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5f22e548fdbc13093ab05182a0d50d50_5278831326343246971.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·真命低语","title_en":"","text":"我听见命运的嚅嗫，低声呼唤我之尊名…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2b3ad95f28e0bd9a09ff248b34a36d8c_4730360980442290095.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/adede97f8e60e68c2f0a76e53baa40b7_2366080107345924477.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/33f5a3fa9f538ef77c68e3880e1adb80_811901741060202659.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b8a25e126b71c8acb3ee938c2d26fa98_4758105784772501860.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·天地创造","title_en":"","text":"哼哼，就让皇女的光采荣耀此间天地吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/cba3ded9b6e4814c1cf434b151d90c6b_6825976808361691820.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/79fc53b87326b1858086d95d917369ec_3988413339737638993.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f33c1868ad3d5d7e7514623be481c995_5803615112877344931.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b5460e95ce5f7609518d47948c4753d1_7339264233778699629.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·彼方之人","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：不知在遥远彼方的扈从…奥兹：毋须担心冒险家协会的大家。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ee2c818b2d2f8974e480cb96b051e987_5488543083250160000.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/1343bc408576827275d1b0bd4b900210_2401569482722636165.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c96438bd92b7daedf35566c1cda06753_5375702013541638681.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a9685197db9fe58a81b03c684b12380e_7015210923780392598.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"雨过天晴","title_en":"","text":"天晴了吗，真舒…咳，此间须臾的霁月光风，就如命运的转折点一般呢！愉快！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/063c2611acd124b5d073df4474c813de_1854254574324775685.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/38b2f99d37a13a5db9967b4a6819cb94_3283699226277637465.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e0c93a0c0fd3bef0d8f97adfe626c2d3_8429893039676643773.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ac26c3aacd36195a9abca6418cca44a0_1131397335340264034.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：啊啊，看那昭告命运的圣裁之雷…奥兹：这么说来，是不是还有衣服没收？菲谢尔：欸？！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/cb06c06c49c3c50f2ec6c5df265c5ecc_8738579864489537666.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c47805eef6775e2e99fd4ddc8a38ed17_2338036756675185704.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/08c15f71dd32ebd5d87f431909351137_5923755111764207374.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/eaee6482c90a0223b63e6f3f22cb03dc_323552994419507960.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雪的时候","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：哼哼，这可是好光景。就像在「那个世界」，罪人的血与泪在断罪的皇女面前凝结的模样呢——啊、啊——阿嚏！阿嚏！奥兹：面对小姐，罪人的鼻涕恐怕都要凝结了。菲谢尔：奥兹——啊、阿嚏！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/30b1e63ba705921bb45c18939456d0e1_383865466287294113.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/53d4680e88a31110864e73f69ed8997a_414710209863733657.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6c4bdd0df2b5e6110ea6295a48873dd5_7677409614098357718.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9304acae60e366431eea8e509f46df53_7786057942080450274.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"阳光很好","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：奥兹，我之眷属啊…奥兹：喔？怎么突然——菲谢尔：以皇女之名，以你的祝圣之翼，遮蔽日月星空，带来永恒的幽夜吧。奥兹：不要强人所难！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e5fc7abf6b38a1ec4ffd89248eb8cf03_714017630425874131.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b8723ec284eb7ecebb201297979a8cdb_6658683715059135507.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2371ec2ec88f7b955b5926f5352ab58e_7481492712704626274.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/436a80114006fbd214d35de676fd6e34_5747388893743027553.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好·问候菲谢尔","title_en":"","text":"昼夜时空皆为虚像，命运的纽带却再次将你带到了我的永恒长夜中。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c00b8f0580f0a14423d5078897ade5db_226073616222581568.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/80e654224a51b6be686322f9976a61bf_7866623320445598088.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ae68c09afab67727bfd48a1cc1dab74b_4483664710975969817.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4c8dabb0040020cbf3622c9120cda6f4_8701666934723158230.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好·问候奥兹","title_en":"","text":"奥兹：早上好！听说你要来，小姐在准备早点…菲谢尔：奥兹！…咳，有何贵干？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/eb6c00f4e42244a15cc27ded7207f70a_7905566398942994017.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/54459f76a2555da7d7d2106217e9bfbf_5752595431299708158.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/31c976ac4655b3b765548d1f1ed2c071_5089466685673777701.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/01684d5dab580a6b6e6544a78e78d27e_6167943848276105194.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"哈…即使贵为皇女，在这样的时辰也不免困乏…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5c939bf46f53b727bdc1953c5a70a1f6_7977623483435916776.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/12ad44ebc9a9ea6487edf7682d5f5596_8569317677569161083.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d9095269953f8b3fd936ccdfc10fef9a_515061714549916875.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/15611154435887acdc1d6cd63147f84d_1883031096953874300.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：天穹上的星光，都是奥兹在无尽的夜幕上啄出来的洞。奥兹：是才怪啦！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d4d6e06de8c2648f80a864e80192e6f2_9102600333081564239.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/76dad8bf9db93088a6c4e0ede2f70718_3717720081064283868.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b4c7474ba3295a180dd4af7817a1ef8c_1216197724882124082.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ddbf7e895861d08a735b630361149b76_108967061748211905.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：你的深眠将平安无梦。毕竟，岂有梦魇，敢染指幽夜净土所祝圣之人…奥兹：她说「晚安」。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/05d3d0a75d3f9e71d9ebd675d046266f_5404768812945052811.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e0890240383e674a70a015e0dd3a61f6_9120818105264234140.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/cc2a0319b4b5312a3254591f27124950_1260563771013604567.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/c036678ced4940b02896306897fdecdf_1449290698010233034.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于菲谢尔自己·断罪之皇女","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：我吗？哼哼。记好了，我乃幽夜净土的主人，断罪之皇女菲谢尔，裁断此世一切罪责，透彻此间一切真知。奥兹：就是冒险家协会的调查员。菲谢尔：…那只是肤浅的表象！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6483a91099571f872b78bc7ab2ead0c3_9182807103437344212.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e0c95e5c1e97f71b194ae11f406c91b1_1188325695831428752.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2ec37598d575c0fe7803ce542ae07127_6398306998470711490.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bb3897a939272c5c5b266e009aaa194c_6128572616820719191.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·降临此间之人","title_en":"","text":"我与你同为异世界的旅人，在此相遇。错不了，想必是命运的意志吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d2f47db0c416e0980dd29ced62bf2bfa_7043261851254648545.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bf657d015ec094b0d4839e56700e347a_4808753299585087893.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9a0dd261cf6bf6173ce61c415c359c25_1077747016647123792.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7e5f3c2b87d81fbb1b1a043bba269d05_2696988984221728065.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·射落世界之兽","title_en":"","text":"看你有什么烦恼的样子…？旅人啊，不必困惑。因为，我以我的左眼，这只透彻因果之丝的「断罪之眼」，守望着你的命运；以奥兹那见证过一千世界寂灭的鸦眼，观察着你的进路。假若名为「世界」的夜巡凶兽觊觎你的梦想，那我便以断罪的圣裁魔矢将其射落！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/21037ec0f871c07c96d577edc64499e1_1721158925860955837.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/75ea9e38676956a3a9a2f5a06640f70e_482762656472044291.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bab14fa5f72425e32e71731ae42a78a6_4416388038812669687.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/af6933d8c55f33caf7094ea01df072d6_2475089401851924748.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·重要之人","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：奥兹，我之忠友啊…能遇到「那个人」，与本皇女同样不属于这个世界的旅人…连残酷的命运，也会对我罪孽深重的血脉，展露微笑呢。就算是我的命运，我无法逃离的「现实」…奥兹：啊啊，我明白。那个旅行者的话，不管发生了什么，都不会抛弃小姐的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ea3e1b54b2c5b96fbcaa83061e82637c_8346206611063248208.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/532f207ab14ee43533a3c0616d0565e1_4869116666773461135.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2700aed627b4630deefd94868e3844ea_8733049794535558081.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6e287cc68154182a2cbeb2c02aad33f3_764328459785369431.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·守望","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：奥兹华尔多·赫芙那梵茵斯。为我，为幽夜净土的主宰，断罪的皇女，做好献出生命的觉悟，守望注定多舛的命运吧。奥兹：不要随便让我送命啊！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5227dbbd7dc8b6a041c4ede9410f3570_8192624020071371088.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/84af22a6ef13248102cb0ef751ee56af_5672646708638208220.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4eaf6a25c65218dd04bb80a24ad405c0_3594314006189685537.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/fda812ab0e9f9e1e612c3f9b9d71d6b7_8618850398490865958.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"嗯？这个「渊色的幽邃秘珠」吗。那是我族的王器，向一切无礼者昭告断罪皇女之仪。即使流落到了这个荒芜的世界，王器仍然追随着皇族之血与崇高之魂，找到了我，这就是无法斩断的因果吧…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/fe6fae63f6cd9bfcffcfb1ccfc9c97d0_64098561692626650.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d097e2d7fa5a96a86c69f6d7c3b69e48_7808553309883372961.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bb1c3ebc6e005874090daafaa8bcb739_3617884428677858516.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5781dcec285cfc0b93b000955c87f1e4_5926292593947115273.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：这么说来，按照这个世界的历法，我有三千多岁了。当然，日月流转的虚像对看破三千宇宙因果的我而言没有意义。奥兹：小姐，这招是骗不过酒保的，没到喝酒的年纪就是没到喝酒的年纪。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/57424d0ce17d4127e483661406100a53_8259753250654419754.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/77a1cf6c2830d86843e2440a62adcc29_2937290142242147660.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f2f69e69848a9a9a087756ce742fa4bf_5802499489838785451.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5437cb12c9d310eaa6ecd717e1f9c6c9_2245963324216843162.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"奥兹的全名，是奥兹华尔多·赫芙那梵茵斯，在「那个世界」主宰着三个宇宙的星海与夜空，以影之翼荫蔽所有战死的勇者之魂。顺带一提，叫错他的名字会被处以拔舌之刑。但我是皇女，而你是我认可的人，所以我们可以随意叫他奥兹。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/11d068fb18cd474d6e874ebb62cb7dd5_1971807502522809805.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/fe469860c19cecb251b9d84efd8c580b_8686482549076240698.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d5445398a38cfb07ccf17a0489787ef0_4876435987635971179.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ca83419bffc0ea748c5a213328a1a1e7_4742595764281788079.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于班尼特","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：那位厄运的少年吗…错不了的，我这只「断罪之眼」见证过，他那被世界唾弃的悲哀——奥兹：那个倒霉蛋，置之不理可不行。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/58d37bda31eca0dfa0fec051433bd7e2_1496940640260197137.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/db06bdcac456ead97c0db00c2fcf5a7f_4831821144265574337.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/54bf1fcd92f788ae9ca31ebd76364871_2020544739124059415.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a01db17a4ecdb28f2a00db24a0e4375a_7479944287942270730.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于丽莎","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：那司书的魔女，坐拥着宇宙知识的宝库…如果能赢取她的信任，或许就能获得伟大智慧…奥兹：她说「图书馆的规矩就是有借有还，再借不难」。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9be7b9381d3949b8ff4fff5e49b57cb5_7887396171930602861.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e73bac035bc229d53c508d5d517f866b_1539208834431010888.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7081b8c655f159d1bbbdfd133ceeb46b_5948541734752416586.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/57c23536979ea5eab0f7f0aeed320077_7935192192931783432.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于凯亚","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：无法看透的真实，无法断明的因果，虚实交织的狂言…那个人，或许也与我一样，背负了「魔眼」的命运…奥兹：也可能暗地里是个海盗…？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5b5a224d220ecf34386c803d47647436_5056874263670966258.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/207e78c99e99754bde0d9288f5d432d1_2971363799882305397.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/94894834c26b36761c8ef5122bda8959_3671125851496382902.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4d79ad6feefb661fc9ee8edf1cea13d2_3669867928136803468.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于莫娜","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：啊啊，那位「伟大的占星术士莫娜」…哼，此人曾经妄图窥探本皇女的命运，结果却浑身颤抖呢。奥兹：当时占星术士似乎在努力憋笑，非常不容易。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3e38a1c583aace4959587d4e17aeab8a_3511164906097111943.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/431afaf5904ca07fca6f6ff99c37a48e_1913237057984428246.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3de22ae6482f9624cc9301128063e4c6_6393552221512190988.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6bf61c7cb3efc58134097be2ed01e392_4691261934382338745.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于罗莎莉亚","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：她吗？似乎是虔信风神的忠实修女呢。奥兹：「虔信」？「忠实」？菲谢尔：没错。有天晚上看到过，她对什么人说「以风神巴托巴斯的名义，去死吧」这样的话，想必是在领祷吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/dff3ff788ddcde1098a723f212771b50_897030175112394129.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6a9f3ab33ce75d89fde611fa4926c69b_1681077994564529846.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f5f6bbf7e679a7d99fc4908b0df44d83_3209979653486979007.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5e9256c30d33f5320a3561b334e1d876_9205544904527759433.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"想要了解菲谢尔·其一","title_en":"","text":"哼哼，为应受罪罚之徒断罪，为命运青睐之人祝圣，以无尽的幽夜净土收容世间一切不被容赦的梦想，这就是断罪皇女血脉背负的沉重使命，谁人也不许质疑。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/46ad92d1a527b974757fbf128a5b7c9f_1652895645700983646.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/55a59121bdc3f67a7f12155dc37713fd_9017445480109206857.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f8cb29c806bf38424039632b34a097ae_2355896746577526378.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/14a2639a64c40cc087cded5c73aa295e_7663700793173955588.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解菲谢尔·其二","title_en":"","text":"我的左眼？我的左眼是透彻世间一切真相的「断罪之眼」。至于为何要遮起来…那么，窥见此间与彼方一切真实的负担与痛，你愿意承受吗？再说了，通晓此世与常世一切妄念与谎言，又是何等无趣的事，哼哼。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/8cd304fd2eec66d56f5a587c52a69795_8019992669859333907.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/5388ad724e806ca30afa32f0d0670b5c_3751330241411697223.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ab96166c3d4c580568580cb3016151ec_5993032002789699907.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/bbc5a90c00b10faefd81b9ce5dbf84ab_850808394141123473.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解菲谢尔·其三","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：风魔龙？那种本皇女寝宫花园里拴着的宠物级别的东西，没想到在这个世界也能形成灾祸呢。哼，一群没用的家伙…奥兹：虽然小姐这么说，当时不也为大家担心得不得了吗。菲谢尔：那、那还不是因为身为皇女，有守护尘世众生一切灵魂的崇高职责…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0c6b9732661e0c68a327df0131374179_4888150491766815036.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/3bb794565efa1fa9bf175ad1da4b5eb8_3287231124539266415.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/89a69a7b86cb28efdef60d2bb0d7c614_7874392440706186327.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e1474a501891b3f307c667298e7db89e_3518729764233595455.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解菲谢尔·其四","title_en":"","text":"奥兹：有的人会用其他的名字呼唤小姐。但对我来说，将生命与力量分给我的人，只有「菲谢尔」这个名字。这才是符合她命运的名字，千万不要弄错…菲谢尔：你们，商谈之事为何？奥兹：关、关于至夜幻现！还有断罪之名！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/88b3e5fda09ec576180e514fefeb7c92_6797327602168878066.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f1a44bd8d3c7aacd63ffc0de901cf30a_8917808825857346337.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0e83d7a75aca47ff604d0f9faede2791_8356613753275228821.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/31299ab2769e2673926856bc4248ae12_7277214579792567859.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解菲谢尔·其五","title_en":"","text":"皇女应断之罪为何，那当然是「违逆命运」了…毕竟，正是命运，让你…是命运，令你我降临此世，将因果交织相连。我、我会守护你，只、只因这是命运的默示录中昭告之事！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/66b6bfdf3812800b8a82f49b95a86d87_2679573047147294921.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/ac8f5562c8fb9704dc64f1c7e0812115_9072532005968455272.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/44311b18dc97cef046f830643a1489b6_3172064877622286106.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/6ae8e5865a43f79083a451a202fbb48e_7113774217057729746.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"菲谢尔的爱好·询问菲谢尔","title_en":"","text":"本皇女驰骋星间，行遍诸多世界，领略过一万种宇宙的命运，通读一切灵魂的默示录。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/01c8c7427b25ab6d79354c1df5f13edb_7625373643487521507.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/329be4b930cae237f4e5924af052c1d3_8224404035915269752.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/52be8368070230c4d53af3574b6a8f58_2087439664679332689.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/354a6e859e697d5dded11da635d60362_4277379173388530276.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"菲谢尔的爱好·询问奥兹","title_en":"","text":"奥兹：小姐喜欢看小说。唉…「奥兹」这个名字，也是她从喜欢的小说里挑的。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/f2810fc97c320f071962cf4ea8c6e16a_3598263975137981357.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2182e14f520ff8afc4073a96912c15b1_789199176632834433.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e3402702dd8aa157690270fee95c3d8c_5720864937482361215.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/27819bdb0a94c01a1ef125323073590d_468013292846762649.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"菲谢尔的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"嗯？这世间能困扰皇女的事情…硬要说的话，那就是，总有人无法接受我的真实身份。但无妨，毕竟高贵者注定孤独嘛。只要我不失却这颗崇高之心…","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/66f3c1abb5839e766136f3ef20a6060f_1341889072959689704.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d2323c022196e99e4e83318ebd1c31f1_3582495019960700183.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/0a61b22cde620316840e8327fe3e4cbf_6906706088344491794.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d2e740466dd0419a0c3289fd16ba0449_4875791965740667927.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：哼，食物只是凡骨肉胎所受的桎梏。但硬要说的话，能配得上断罪皇女的，那莫过于罪人之泪与谎言之舌…奥兹：并不是小姐常做的「常夜夏宫蜜吐司」吗？菲谢尔：——只，只是为了补充这具躯壳所需的能量！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4f0cc71a525043c9821157bdbd675ba7_4319369724709558292.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4aaffb242690a7764ca96d41e7b0f972_2960007936153773209.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/48a12a7e49773b153bde630110974b70_5432860990261561378.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a9ace4831db74b9c27e8f46d69f991ba_3896676991919888143.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"讨厌的食物","title_en":"","text":"奥兹：小姐讨厌的，应该是那个吧…菲谢尔：那个吗。被违抗自然的锁链束缚的肢体…奥兹：再也不能如我这般飞翔…菲谢尔：失去了那生来便仰慕皇族王者的卑下头颅，简直是「那个世界」的地狱略影。其名为…奥兹：好像是叫什么酿鸡来着？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/e55b35722018ca0b82933dfe36b15275_8707113714136034951.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4293c66c6cb0f1cfe2e1a4de0aed3b3d_1953660035138056984.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4ab7dbae8ed84ac23d901b8badde87f1_7254238774387037262.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9a578cebac4c97a332cf235c459827d7_2739148014715929766.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：此等珍馐，可纳于忘忧之御膳园中。奥兹：小姐说，这就是她理想的美味。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/a62f123e529a76c5dd0bd78aa331a85c_7634617170641584892.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/03bbd225e0864851b2ffda300d1d0895_4372209189910639136.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/9305d47038ded9e01de664e205d21ad7_1595228443132066718.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/4fd0b492338faa9742c662d7f033ee74_1559877053181158682.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：为射落世界之兽，必须突破尘俗欲望，编织通向命运之间的道路。奥兹：但刚才，小姐不是吃得很香吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b1ca4c2cfdc18691130c11ec7ec5f6f3_6547550409634845334.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d05ea858c33dcad9c8ba692b746e126f_1138355432056140702.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b6555e45b3f42397407b06c0a6ed5603_468642537210118653.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/b2b1dcb6bc15b258439c6d8e4049625b_2791874505270257366.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：为何要将残破与毁灭，呈于本皇女面前？奥兹：小姐不太喜欢这道菜肴，请你见谅。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/cf98422f21fcec4e095d21d694489a91_7126509387855404009.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/2e0c5ff37f0cc6cf930860ce547c3352_3446807093650700656.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/d865c2d004e7016ec1546659782042f7_2250060577443208436.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/12/7599fb96b461cc9628988515a9ca8be7_3984134855234098301.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"生日","title_en":"","text":"菲谢尔：哼哼，既然今日是你的命定之日，那我不可能坐视不管。来，说吧！在这腐朽而幽邃的世界里，在你渺小而短暂的人生中，有什么想要实现的愿望，尽管说来，让本皇女听听！嗯…即使是…奥兹：她说「生日快乐，如果你想要，她」…菲谢尔：奥兹！多嘴！","text_en":"","audio